          "_key": "saiz",
          "text": "If you get into a car accident in Boulder, there are steps you can take to immediately protect your rights and begin building a claim against the other driver. If possible, carry out the following actions in the aftermath of a vehicle collision:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
