    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baj4",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saj3",
          "text": "Move your disabled vehicle to the side of the road, to a safe place.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baj6",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saj5",
          "text": "Check yourself and others at the scene for any physical injuries.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baj8",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saj7",
          "text": "Call the police to report the accident, even if it is minor.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baja",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saj9",
          "text": "Exchange information with the other driver.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajc",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajb",
          "text": "When the police arrive, give your side of the story. Do not admit fault.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baje",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajd",
          "text": "Take as many photographs as you can at the scene of the accident before you leave.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajg",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajf",
          "text": "Go to a hospital in Denver for immediate medical care.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "baji",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajh",
          "text": "Collect information and documentation related to your auto accident.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajk",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajj",
          "text": "File a car insurance claim, but speak to an attorney before settling.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "number",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajp",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lajm",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/denver-car-accident-lawyer/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajl",
          "text": "Do not worry if you are unable to complete all of these steps after a car accident. Our ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajn",
          "text": "Denver car accident lawyers",
          "marks": [
            "lajm"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajo",
          "text": " can optimize your chances of a positive case outcome, either way, using aggressive legal tactics.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajr",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajq",
          "text": "Colorado Car Accident Statute of Limitations",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajt",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajs",
          "text": "A statute of limitations is a law that places a strict deadline on the ability to file a civil claim. Statutes of limitations are different from state to state, as well as according to the type of case. Your deadline may differ, for example, if you are filing a claim for a car accident compared to medical malpractice.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajv",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "saju",
          "text": "In Colorado, the statute of limitations on most car accident claims is three years from the date of the crash. The clock may start ticking from the date of injury discovery if this date differs from that of the collision. Note that this is one year longer than the time limit on other types of personal injury cases in Colorado (two years). If you are filing a claim against the government in Colorado, however, you will only have 180 days to take legal action.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajx",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajw",
          "text": "How Much Compensation Can I Recover?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bajz",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sajy",
          "text": "The financial compensation you can recover for a car accident in Boulder, Colorado depends on the unique circumstances of your case. Although cases involving severe injuries generally result in greater compensation than minor injury claims, each case is unique.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bak1",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sak0",
          "text": "The recovery that may be available will depend on factors such as your diagnosis and prognosis, your age, and your income. You may be eligible to recover compensation for losses such as property repairs, past and future medical bills, lost wages, physical pain and emotional suffering. An attorney from Dormer Harpring can evaluate your claim’s value today.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bak3",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sak2",
          "text": "Contact Our Boulder Car Accident Lawyers",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "bak8",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "lak5",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/boulder-personal-injury-attorney/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sak4",
          "text": "No matter what type of negligence caused your car accident injuries, we can help. Call our ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sak6",
          "text": "Boulder personal injury attorneys",
          "marks": [
            "lak5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "sak7",
          "text": " today to start moving towards a favorable resolution to your legal matter. At Dormer Harpring, your whole healing process matters; let us handle your legal issues so you can focus on your mental, emotional, and physical health.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
